This Terraform configuration creates an Elastic Beanstalk application and sets up an app version lifecycle policy to retain each version for 5 days. The configuration includes the necessary AWS provider setup, IAM roles, and Elastic Beanstalk resources. The lifecycle policy ensures that versions are automatically deleted after 5 days, helping manage version history and reduce storage costs.

---

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "environment_name" {
  description = "Name of the Elastic Beanstalk environment"
  default     = "my-beanstalk-env"
