This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Lex Bot for ordering pizzas. The bot will be configured with an NLU (Natural Language Understanding) intent confidence threshold of 0.5, which means the bot will only respond to user input if it is at least 50% confident in the intent. The configuration includes the necessary AWS Lex Bot and related resources, such as the intent and slot types, and ensures that the bot is set up for use in a production environment.

