This Terraform configuration creates a custom DAX (DynamoDB Accelerator) parameter group in AWS. A DAX parameter group defines the configuration settings for a DAX cluster, such as the cache size, cache expiration, and other performance-related parameters. This configuration uses the `aws_dax_parameter_group` resource to define a custom parameter group with a specified name and description, and it includes a set of parameters that can be used to fine-tune the behavior of the DAX cluster.

The configuration includes a default name for the parameter group and a set of default parameters. It is designed to be deployable in AWS using Terraform version 1.9.8 or higher and the `hashicorp/aws` provider version 5.75 or higher.

