**Description of the Terraform Program:**

This Terraform configuration creates a SageMaker Pipeline resource in AWS. The pipeline will be defined using the `aws_sagemaker_pipeline` resource. The pipeline will be associated with a SageMaker Studio domain and will be configured with a pipeline definition stored in an S3 bucket. The configuration includes:

- A provider block for AWS with a specified region.
- An S3 bucket to store the pipeline definition.
- A SageMaker Studio domain (optional but recommended for integration).
- A SageMaker Pipeline resource with a name and a pipeline definition S3 URI.
- IAM roles are created as needed to allow SageMaker to access the S3 bucket and other AWS services.

Variables are defined with default values for flexibility.

---

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "s3_bucket_name" {
  description = "The name of the S3 bucket to store the pipeline definition."
  default     = "sagemaker-pipeline-definition-bucket"
}

variable "sagemaker_pipeline_name" {
  description = "The name of the SageMaker pipeline."
  default     = "example-sagemaker-pipeline"
}

variable "sagemaker_studio_domain_name" {
  description = "The name of the SageMaker Studio domain (optional)."
  default     = ""
}

variable "iam_role_arn" {
  description = "The ARN of the IAM role to be used by the SageMaker pipeline."
  default     = "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/SageMakerPipelineRole"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "pipeline_definition_bucket" {
  bucket = var.s3_bucket_name
  acl    = "private"
}

resource "aws_sagemaker_pipeline" "example_pipeline" {
  name = var.sagemaker_pipeline_name

  pipeline_definition_s3_uri = "s3://${aws_s3_bucket.pipeline_definition_bucket.bucket}/pipeline.json"

  role_arn = var.iam_role_arn
}

resource "aws_sagemaker_studio_domain" "example_domain" {
  domain_name = var.sagemaker_studio_domain_name
  auth_mode   = "SAML"
  subnet_ids  = ["subnet-12345678", "subnet-87654321"]
  vpc_id      = "vpc-12345678"
}
```

**Note:** The `aws_sagemaker_studio_domain` resource is optional and can be omitted if not needed. The `iam_role_arn` should be replaced with a valid IAM role ARN that allows SageMaker to access the S3 bucket and other required services. The pipeline definition file (`pipeline.json`) should be uploaded to the S3 bucket manually or via another Terraform resource.

