This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) with an Egress-Only Internet Gateway (EIG) attached. The VPC will be configured with a default CIDR block, and the EIG will be associated with a public subnet. The configuration includes a provider block for AWS in the `us-east-1` region, and all necessary resources are declared explicitly.

---

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "vpc_cidr_block" {
  description = "The CIDR block for the VPC."
  default     = "10.0.0.0/16"
}

variable "public_subnet_cidr" {
  description = "The CIDR block for the public subnet."
  default     = "10.0.1.0/24"
}

