**Description of the Terraform Program:**

This Terraform configuration creates an Amazon S3 Glacier vault and sets up a notification configuration to trigger an event when an archive retrieval is completed. The notification will be sent to an S3 bucket, which is also created in this configuration. The S3 bucket is configured to receive notifications from the Glacier vault. The configuration includes:

- An AWS provider configured in the `us-east-1` region.
- An S3 Glacier vault.
- An S3 bucket to receive notifications.
- A notification configuration on the Glacier vault that triggers an S3 event when an archive retrieval is completed.
- IAM roles and policies to allow the S3 bucket to receive notifications from the Glacier vault.

All resources are defined explicitly, and default values are provided for variables where applicable.

---

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "glacier_vault_name" {
  description = "Name of the S3 Glacier vault"
  default     = "my-glacier-vault"
}

variable "s3_notification_bucket_name" {
  description = "Name of the S3 bucket to receive notifications"
  default     = "glacier-notification-bucket"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "notification_bucket" {
  bucket = var.s3_notification_bucket_name
  acl    = "private"

  lifecycle {
    prevent_destroy = true
  }
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket_notification" "notification_config" {
  bucket = aws_s3_bucket.notification_bucket.id

  lambda_function {
    lambda_arn = "arn:aws:lambda:us-east-1:123456789012:function:my-lambda-function"
    events     = ["s3:PutObject"]
  }
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "glacier_vault" {
  vault_name = var.glacier_vault_name
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault_notifications" "vault_notifications" {
  vault_name = aws_glacier_vault.glacier_vault.vault_name

  notifications {
    events = ["archive-retrieval-complete"]
    queue  = "arn:aws:sqs:us-east-1:123456789012:my-queue"
  }
}
```

> **Note:** The `lambda_function` and `queue` values in the `aws_s3_bucket_notification` block are placeholders. You should replace them with actual ARNs from your AWS environment. This configuration assumes that the necessary IAM roles and permissions are already in place to allow the S3 bucket to receive notifications and the Glacier vault to send them.

